#!/bin/sh
# Say whether a game is running from this runtime: exits 0 when one is, 1 when none is. Other
# Wine installations do not count (hadron-procs.sh). Hadron's window asks before it lets the app,
# and the runtime inside it, be replaced by an update.
ROOT="$(cd "$(dirname "$0")/.." && pwd)"
. "$ROOT/scripts/hadron-procs.sh"
hadron_candidates | while read -r pid rss start; do
    is_hadron_process "$pid" && exit 3
done
[ $? -eq 3 ]
